<!--
    Greenfield XP: Media.xaml — Windows XP Luna Blue iconography.
    - Icon<Role> geometries: crisp 20x20 XP-proportioned vector glyphs drawn via IconTemplate in inherited Foreground
      so toolbar, sidebar, caption, and hover states recolor cleanly with ThemeModifier.
    - Menu icons (24 Playnite keys): rich 48x48 (4x supersampled) full-color 32-bit XP-style glossy PNGs
      generated deterministically by art/icons.py into Images/WinXP/*.png.
-->
